    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d276">

                <pb facs="0392" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg286"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr.
                            Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic">January 13, 1892</hi>.</date>
                        (Received 3 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have just placed in safety on board <hi rendition="#italic">Yorktown</hi>
                    remaining five refugees from my legation, also two refugees from Spanish
                    legation, who were accompanied by Spanish minister. Italian minister also
                    accompanied.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Egan</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
